ure','r.room_ID')} temperature,${LATEST('humidity','r.room_ID')} humidity,${LATEST('occupied','r.room_ID')} occupied FROM Room r JOIN Building b ON b.building_ID=r.building_ID ORDER BY r.room_ID DESC LIMIT 1`);return msg;",
